== Notes ==
* Consuming Zhaitaffy while [[Sugar Rush]] is active can result in vomiting, represented by a green cloud and the loss of the speed boost, limiting the use of Zhaitaffy for constant increased [[Movement speed]].

== Trivia ==
* The name is a [[w:portmanteau|portmanteau]] of [[Zhaitan]] and [[w:Taffy (candy)|taffy]].
* During the Living World Season 2 story step [[Hidden Arcana]], [[Kasmeer Meade]] describes her legs as feeling "like Zhaitaffy".
* Historically, consuming 250 Zhaitaffy would complete the [[Dragon Bash (2013 achievements)|Zhaitasty achievement]]. A new [[Dragon Bash (achievements)|Zhaitasty achievement]] was introduced in 2019, requiring 5000 Zhaitaffy.

